{"id":"wb-3-179","name":"松江唐经幢","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"松江唐经幢","text":"松江唐经幢，又称松江唐代陀罗尼经石幢，位于中华人民共和国上海市松江区中山街道上海市松江区中山小学内，为上海市境内现存最古老的地面文物，建成于公元859年，此后因年久失修加之风化等缘故而发生倾斜，1963年时被修复，1988年1月13日，被公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%BE%E6%B1%9F%E5%94%90%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2","revisionId":92650797,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92650797","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c06d5af6a9bc8a3044fdd347.jpg","title":"Tang_Tuoluoni_Jingchuang.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tang_Tuoluoni_Jingchuang.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/Tang_Tuoluoni_Jingchuang.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fayhoo","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​唐陀罗尼经幢 松江区中山小学内\n在此感谢松江的蒋老师带我进入松江中山小学内进行拍摄！","width":320,"height":480}}